%[text] # <u>**Step 1:**</u>
%[text] 
%[text] To begin with using other AI-based software in MATLAB, install the [LLMs with MATLAB support package](https://www.mathworks.com/matlabcentral/fileexchange/163796-large-language-models-llms-with-matlab). You can either download it from file exchange or you can use the Add-On explorer ![](text:image:4bed) in the main MATLAB window. This is a package that provides the ability to connect MATLAB to ChatGPT™, DALL·E™, OpenAI® models in Azure®, and Ollama™.
%%
%[text]{"align":"center"} ![](text:image:8a3a)
%%
%[text] ![](text:image:5c97) **Note**. Using this LLM support package requires **MATLAB R2024a or newer**. *This capability is currently not supported through MATLAB Online. Ensure that this support package is added to your MATLAB path.*
%[text] 
%[text] **You can add the path using the following button:**
  %[control:button:4e4b]{"position":[1,2]}
locatePath = what('+llms');
oldPath = strsplit(locatePath(1).path,'+');
newPath = oldPath{1};
addpath(newPath)
%%
%[text] # <u>**Step 2:**</u>
%[text] 
%[text] Download the Ollama platform here: [https://ollama.com/download.](https://ollama.com/download.)
%%
%[text]{"align":"center"} ![](text:image:8744)
%%
%[text] # <u>**Step 3:**</u>
%[text] 
%[text] Install Ollama on your machine using the `OllamaSetup` file that was downloaded. Allow it to fully download before proceeding to the next step.
%%
%[text]{"align":"center"} ![](text:image:97e5)
%%
%[text] # <u>**Step 4:**</u>
%[text] 
%[text] Open a new Command Prompt (Windows) or Terminal (Mac). Type in the following command to pull the specific model you want. For this specific example, replace `modelname` with **`mistral-nemo`**`.`
%[text] ```
%[text] ollama pull modelname
%[text] ```
%%
%[text]{"align":"center"} ![](text:image:1cec)
%%
%[text] ![](text:image:8cac) **Note**. The minimum system requirements to run the mistral-nemo model requires a machine with at least **12GB+ VRAM** (for GPU) or **16GB-32GB RAM** (for CPU).
%%
%[text] # <u>**Step 5:**</u>
%[text] 
%[text] Allow the model installation to finish in the Command Prompt or Terminal, then close it. Open MATLAB and try the following commands to see if your installation was successful:
%[text] ```matlabCodeExample
%[text] % Create LLM Connection with 4 minute timeout
%[text] Chat = ollamaChat("mistral-nemo","TimeOut",240)
%[text] 
%[text] % Execute sample prompt
%[text] generate(Chat,"Hello World!")
%[text] ```
%%
%[text] # <u>**Step 6:**</u>
%[text] 
%[text] Once you have confirmed proper installation, return back to the **GenAIFundamentals.m** script to complete the demonstration. You can use the following link:
%[text] [⇦ Return To GenAIFundamentals.m](file:../Scripts/GenAIFundamentals.m:M_126e)


%%
